#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Mu buryo busanzwe, Ikusanyamakuru rikuru rya Kadupul rizabika urubuga rwose n'imigereka (plugins) mu Bubiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikoresho (Resource Cache). Hanyuma, buri gihe runaka Ibikusanyamakuru bya Kure bizajya byivugurura n'ivugurura ryose riturutse ku Ikusanyamakuru rikuru rya Kadupul. Ubu Bubiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikoresho mu by'ukuri bwemerera Ibikusanyamakuru bya Kure kwivugurura ubwabyo. Niba udashaka gukoresha iri genamiterere, ushobora kurihagarika ukoresheje iri genamiterere."

