#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Uburenganzira ku Gishushanyo butangwa mu buryo butaziguye binyuze ku burenganzira bw'igishushanyo muri buri buryo. Ubworoheje (Permissive) bunatanga uburenganzira iyo umukoresha afite uburenganzira ku gikoresho cyangwa ku cyitegererezo cy'igishushanyo. Ubukomeye (Restrictive) busaba uburenganzira ku gikoresho no ku cyitegererezo igihe nta burenganzira butaziguye ku gishushanyo buhari. Uburyo bushingiye ku Gikoresho (Device Based) busaba uburenganzira ku gikoresho, naho ubushingiye ku Cyitegererezo cy'Igishushanyo (Graph Template Based) bugasaba uburenganzira ku cyitegererezo. Amategeko y'umukoresha n'ay'itsinda asuzumwa ukwayo maze ibisubizo byemewe bigahuzwa. Ubu buryo buhana umuvuduko w'isuzuma ry'ububiko n'uburenganzira bunonosoye ku mashami manini."

