#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Mu mateka, abayobozi ba Kadupul bashyizeho Uburyo bworoshye bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru burimo amabwiriza nka \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" kugira ngo bahagararire agaciro k'umubare gakoreshwa mu Bishushanyo bya Kadupul. Muri verisiyo za kera za Kadupul, ibi byari byemewe. Nyamara, ubu ni uburyo butizewe kuko ari inzira yatuma abandi bakoresha bashyira ahagaragara Inyandikorugero z'Amakuru zidafite umutekano. Muri Kadupul ya none, ubu buryo bugomba kwirindwa. Ariko rero, dutanga iri genamiterere niba ufite Uburyo bwa kera bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru burimo izi Nyuguti zidasanzwe zidafite umutekano kandi ukaba utarazihinduye ngo zibe inyandiko z'imbere mu bubiko bwa 'scripts'. Igihe iri genamiterere ritarimo akamenyetso, Kadupul ikumira inyuguti zidasanzwe za shell nk'udusubiramo (quotation marks), udufungo duhinnye, imirongo ihagaritse, udushyirwaho inyuma (backslashes), na backticks. Kadupul ikomeza kwemerera ibimenyetso bya kiruta na kigabanya ku bintu nka <path_cacti> no ku bipimo byinjizwa, ariko niba iri genamiterere ritarimo akamenyetso, aho ni ho ikoreshwa ryabyo ryemewe rigarukira."

