msgstr "Ni OID zingahe zigomba gusubizwa kuri buri cyifuzo cya snmpbulkwalk? Ku Bikoresho bifite ibiti binini bya SNMP, kongera iyi ngano bizongera umuvuduko wo kongera gutondeka (re-index) kuri WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many log files do you wish to retain?  Use 0 to never remove any logs. (0-365)"
msgstr "Ni amadosiye angahe y'ibikorwa wifuza kugumana? Koresha 0 kugira ngo utazasiba na rimwe. (0-365)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How often do you want the Kadupul log display to update?"
msgstr "Ni kangahe wifuza ko iyerekanwa rya Log ya Kadupul rivugururwa?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How should Kadupul support Client Dates based upon the Client browser's timezone."
msgstr "Uko Kadupul igomba gushyigikira amatariki y'Umukoresha hashingiwe ku isaha y'akarere ka mushakisha (browser) y'umukoresha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How will Kadupul handle event logging?"
msgstr "Ni gute Kadupul izajya yandika amakuru y'ibikorwa?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like Kadupul to present dates?  This setting will also change the way that Kadupul Graphs dates are represented."
msgstr "Ni gute wifuza ko Kadupul yerekana amatariki? Iri genamiterere rizahindura kandi uburyo amatariki agaragara ku bishushanyo bya Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ni gute wifuza ko amakosa y'ibisohoka by'Igikusanya amakuru yandikwa? Amahitamo arimo: 'Birambuye' bisobanura buri kosa, 'Incamake' itanga umubare w'amakosa y'ibisohoka kuri buri Gikoresho, na 'Nta na kimwe', idatanga umubare w'amakosa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Niba hashyizweho akamenyetso, Kadupul izandika amakuru y'inyongera ya LDAP muri Log ya Kadupul mu gihe cy'ibikorwa byo Guhuza (Binding) no Gushakisha (Searching)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Kadupul cannot determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Niba Kadupul idashobora kumenya umuvuduko w'umuyoboro (interface) bitewe n'uko ifSpeed cyangwa ifHighSpeed bitashyizweho cyangwa bingana na zeru, ni akahe gaciro ntarengwa wifuza kuri dosiye za RRD zizavamo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a Device Data Source is included in an Aggregate Graph, show that Graph along with other Device Graphs"
msgstr "Niba Inkomoko y'amakuru y'Igikoresho iri mu Gishushanyo gihurije hamwe, erekana icyo Gishushanyo hamwe n'ibindi Bishushanyo by'Igikoresho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Niba umukoresha yemejwe kandi agahitamo 'Komeza undeke ninjiye', hazaremwa cookie y'iyemeza kuri mudasobwa ye imwemerera kuguma yinjiye. Cookie y'iyemeza ita agaciro nyuma y'iminsi 90 idakoreshwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Niba Proxy nkuru n'iy'ingoboka zombi zishobora kwakirwa, iri hitamo rituma ibisabwa byose kuri RRDtool bisaranganywa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Kadupul will remember your Tree History between logins and when you return to the Graphs page."
msgstr "Niba byemejwe, Kadupul izibuka amateka y'igiti cyawe (Tree History) hagati yo kwinjira n'igihe ugarutse ku rupapuro rw'Ibishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Niba bishyizwe ku Bworoshye, Ibishushanyo n'Inkomoko y'amakuru bishobora kuremwa gusa bivuye muri Ibishushanyo Bishya.  Niba ari ku Rwego rwo hejuru, uburyo bwa kera bwo kurema Ibishushanyo n'Inkomoko y'amakuru burashyigikirwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
