#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log."
msgstr "Niba igikusanyamakuru cya Boost kirengeje iki gihe cy'imikorere, umuburo uzashyirwa mu nyandiko y'ibyabaye ya Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Niba ubu bubiko butarimo ubusa, amadosiye yawe ya RRD y'umwimerere azabikirwa ikopi y'ingoboka muri ubu bubiko."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost poller process."
msgstr "Niba aka gace katari ubusa, Boost izandika ibisohoka bya RRDUpdate biturutse mu gikorwa cy'igikusanyamakuru cya Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Niba iri genamiterere rishyizweho akamenyetso, Kadupul izuzuza imbonerahamwe za SNMP Agent amakuru y'ibikoresho na sisitemu ya Kadupul. Ntabwo yemeza SNMP Agent ubwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with Kadupul's Data Collectors, set this file path and the Data Collectors' standard error will be redirected to this file"
msgstr "Niba ufite ibibazo ku bikusanyamakuru bya Kadupul, shyiraho iyi nzira ya dosiye maze amakosa asanzwe y'ibikusanyamakuru azajye yoherezwa muri iyi dosiye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Niba uhisemo iri genamiterere, Kadupul izagerageza kuringaniza umutwaro wa buri gikorwa cy'ikusanyamakuru (poller) igabanya mu buryo bungana ibintu bikusanyirizwa amakuru kuri buri gikorwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Niba uhisemo iri genamiterere, Kadupul izasuzuma ibisohoka birengeje ubushobozi bwa Kadupul bwo kubibika kandi itange umuburo igihe ibibonye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Niba wifuza guhagarika burundu igikorwa cyo gukusanya amakuru (polling), kuraho aka kamenyetso."

