#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Umubare w'ibanze w'ibikorwa bikorera icyarimwe kuri buri Ikusanyamakuru. IKITONDERWA: Guhera kuri Kadupul 1.2, iri genamiterere ribikwa mu Ikusanyamakuru. Kujya mbere, aka gaciro ni igenamiterere ry'ibanze gusa ku Ikusanyamakuru. Gukoresha umubare munini igihe ukoresha cmd.php bizazamura umuvuduko. Kuzamura umuvuduko muri Spine bikemuka neza ukoresheje igipimo cya threads. Igihe ukoresha Spine, dusaba umubare muto maze ugakoresha threads aho kuba ibikorwa byinshi. Igihe ukoresha cmd.php, ntukarenze inshuro 2 umubare w'imitima ya CPU (CPU cores)."

