#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Hari uburyo butatu bwo gusimbuza. Uburyo bwa mbere busimbuza izamuka ridasanzwe impuzandengo y'inkomoko y'amakuru irebwa. Uburyo bwa kabiri busimbuza izamuka ridasanzwe agaciro ka 'NaN'. Uburyo bwa nyuma busimbuza izamuka ridasanzwe agaciro keza ka nyuma kazwi kabonetse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bubiri bwo gukuraho. Uburyo bwa mbere, Ikigero cy'itandukaniro (Standard Deviation), bukuraho urugero urwo ari rwo rwose ruri ku ntera y'ibigero X by'itandukaniro uvuye ku mpuzandengo y'ingero. Uburyo bwa kabiri, Ihindagurika (Variance), bukuraho urugero urwo ari rwo rwose rurenze X% ku mpuzandengo y'ihindagurika. Uburyo bw'ihindagurika bwita ku mubare runaka w'ingero zidasanzwe ('outliers'). Izo ni ingero zidasanzwe, nk'izamuka ridasanzwe (spike), ziba zigomba gukurwa mu ibara ry'impuzandengo y'ihindagurika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Iri genamiterere rigenzurirwa ku rwego rw'Ikusanyamakuru. Agaciro kari hano ni ak'ibanze gusa gakoreshwa igihe Ikusanyamakuru rishya riremwaho bwa mbere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Iyi ni konti ya imeri ikoreshwa mu kohereza ubutumwa bw'igerageza kugira ngo wemeze ko byose bikora neza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare w'inyuguti zizemererwa mbere y'uko umurongo wo muri imeri ukatwa mu buryo bwikora. (0 = Yahagaritswe)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
