msgstr "Iri ni izina rya seriveri/IP ya seriveri ya SMTP uzoherezaho imeri. Ku bw'uburinzi igihe imwe ihagaze, tandukanya za seriveri zawe ukoresheje akabago n'akitso."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Aha ni ho kuri seriveri y'urubuga amadosiye ya RRDfiles n'amadosiye ya PNG azabikwa by'agateganyo. Ubu bubiko bw'agateganyo buzacungwa na poller. Reba neza ko ufite uburenganzira nyabwo bwo gusoma no kwandika muri ubu bubiko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare ntarengwa w'iminsi mbere y'uko ijambobanga rita agaciro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare ntarengwa w'iminsi mbere y'uko konti zidakoreshwa zihagarikwa. Konti ya Admin ntiyarebwa n'iri tegeko."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ubu ni bwo burebure buto bw'amagambobanga yemewe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Iki ni igihe gito cyemewe hagati y'ivugurura ry'Igishushanyo. Iyi ndangagaciro ikoreshwa kandi mu gushyiraho ibiranga bimwe bya RRDfile. Niba ufite Igikoresho kibika amakuru by'agateganyo kandi kidatanga ivugurura ry'igihe nyacyo, ushobora gukenera kongera Intera nto fatizo yo kuvugurura kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibishushanyo birimo ibyuho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Iyi ni inzira igana kuri sendmail kuri seriveri yawe. (Ikoreshwa gusa iyo Sendmail yatoranyijwe nka Serivisi y'imeri)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Aha ni ho hantu ha seriveri hazakoreshwa ku miyoboro igana ku rubuga rwa Kadupul. Hagomba kubamo n'ububiko bw'imbere niba Kadupul idakorera mu bubiko shingiro (root folder)."

#: include/global_settings.php
