msgstr "Iri genamiterere rizajya risimburanya Log ya Kadupul buri gihe runaka."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Ibi byerekeza ku kiranga cyihariye mu bubiko bwa LDAP kibika amazina y'abakoresha b'abanyamuryango b'itsinda. Ni ngombwa kwemeza ko agaciro k'ikiranga gahura n'igenamiterere ryatanzwe muri \"Izina ryihariye\" cyangwa ko agaciro nyako k'ikiranga gashobora gushakishwa hakoreshejwe igenamiterere ryagaragajwe muri \"Izina ryihariye\"."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Iri genamiterere ni irya sisitemu zifite poller imwe gusa kugira ngo zongere zubake imbonerahamwe y'ibisohoka bya poller kuri buri nshuro yo gukusanya amakuru kugira ngo imbonerahamwe yo mu bubiko itimukira muri swap kuri sisitemu nini cyane zifite ububiko bunini bw'amakuru bwashobora gukoresha swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Aka gaciro kagaragaza umubare ntarengwa w'amazamuka adasanzwe ugomba gukurwa muri RRA y'Igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples that will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Aka gaciro kagaragaza umubare w'ingero z'impuzandengo zo hejuru n'izo hasi zizakurwa mu itsinda ry'ingero mbere yo kubara Impuzandengo y'ihindagurika. Nuhitamo agaciro k'ingero zidasanzwe ka 5, impuzandengo 5 zo hejuru na 5 zo hasi zombi zizakurwaho."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Aka gaciro kagaragaza ijanisha riri hejuru y'impuzandengo y'ingero yatunganyijwe nyuma y'uko ingero zidasanzwe zikuwe mu rugero. Urugero, Ijanisha ry'ihindagurika rya 100%% ku mpuzandengo yatunganyijwe ya 50 ryakuraho urugero urwo ari rwo rwose ruri hejuru y'umubare wa 100 mu gishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ibi bizasaba ko amagambobanga yose ashaje na yo yuzuza ibisabwa bishya by'ubukomere igihe cyo kwinjira. Niba bitujujwe, bizahita bisaba guhindura ijambobanga."

#: include/global_settings.php
