#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Iyo Boost yohereje amategeko yo kuvugurura kuri RRDtool, ntigomba kurenza uburebure ntarengwa bw'ibishingirwaho mu itegeko bwa sisitemu y'imikorere.  Ibi bihinduka bitewe na sisitemu y'imikorere n'urwego rwa kernel.  Urugero: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ nta mupaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be shown inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, ubufasha bw'Ifishi n'Igenamiterere buzagaragara aho bwanditse imbere.  Bitabaye ibyo, buzagaragara igihe utunze imbeba kuri buto y'ubufasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Igihe hashyizweho akamenyetso, buri gikorwa cyose cyo kwinjira muri Kadupul kizajya cyoherezwa kuri HTTPS kugira ngo umutekano ube mwinshi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs?"
msgstr "Igihe uhanga raporo nshya, ni ubuhe bwoko bw'ishusho bugomba gukoreshwa ku bishushanyo biri mu nyandiko?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating graphs, what Graph Type would you like preselected?"
msgstr "Iyo urema ibishushanyo, ni ubuhe bwoko bw'Igishushanyo wifuza ko buba bwatoranyijwe mbere?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Igihe bihagaritswe, Ikoreshwa ryikora (Automation) rya Kadupul ntirizakora Igishushanyo na kimwe mu buryo bwikora. Ibi bifasha igihe uhindura igenamiterere ry'Igikoresho kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibishushanyo bishya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Guhamagara Amategeko y'Ikoreshwa ryikora n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Igihe bihagaritswe, Ikoreshwa ryikora (Automation) rya Kadupul ntirizakora Ikintu cyo mu Giti (Tree Item) na kimwe mu buryo bwikora. Ibi bifasha igihe uhindura igenamiterere ry'Igikoresho cyangwa ry'Igishushanyo kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibyinjizwa mu Giti bishya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Guhamagara Amategeko n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When displaying Graphs, allow Graph Dates to extend 'to future'"
msgstr "Igihe werekana Ibishushanyo, emera Amatariki y'Igishushanyo kwagukira 'mu gihe kizaza'"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Igihe byemejwe, Kadupul ntizafunga Ibishushanyo. Ibi bituma umuntu ahindura mu buryo bwihuse n'intoki Inkomoko z'amakuru zijyanye n'Igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Igihe byemejwe, Kadupul izashyira akabuto ko guhitamo kuri Siba Inkomoko z'amakuru zijyanye n'Igishushanyo igihe ukuraho Ibishushanyo. Ikitonderwa: Kadupul ntizemera ikurwaho ry'Inkomoko z'amakuru niba zikoreshwa mu bindi Bishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Igihe udakoresha igenzura ry'imyandikire rishingiye ku Mugaragarire (Theme), ibisobanuro by'imyandikire ya Pango bikoreshwa ku Bishushanyo byose, nka DejaVu Sans. Ku mahitamo yawe, ushobora kuhasiga ubusa maze ukagenzura igenamiterere ry'imyandikire kuri buri kintu ukacyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Iyo hakorwa igikorwa cyo gukuraho amazamuka adasanzwe mu kivunge, inyandikorugero zahiswemo hasi aha gusa ni zo zizakorwaho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Kadupul log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha Syslog/Eventlog mu kwandika amakuru y'ibikorwa, ubutumwa bwa Log ya Kadupul buzajya bwoherezwa kuri Syslog/Eventlog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha iyemeza ry'ibanze (Basic Auth), niba konti y'ibanze ikeneye guhindurwa muri konti yo kwinjira itandukanye, ushobora gutanga idosiye ya CSV hano kugira ngo uhuze konti y'ibanze na konti yo kwinjira wifuza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha iyemezwa ry'ibanze, niba hari ibibazo byo guhuza izina ry'umukoresha na konti ya Kadupul yemewe, ubutumwa bwanditswe hano buzagaragarizwa abakoresha. Bushobora kubamo inyandiko isanzwe na HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Device name filter dropdowns, checking this option will strip the domain from the hostname."
msgstr "Iyo ureba urutonde rumanuka rw'umuyunguruzi w'izina ry'Igikoresho, guhitamo ubu buryo bizakuraho domain ku izina rya hostname."

