#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Kugeza ubu, nta na kimwe mu bice by'inyongera by'ibanze bya Kadupul (Plugins) cyongeye gutegurwa kugira ngo gikorane n'Ibikusanyamakuru bya kure. Kubw'ibyo, Inyongera nka MacTrack na HMIB, zisaba kugera ku bikoresho mu buryo butaziguye, ntizizakorana n'Ibikusanyamakuru bya kure kuri ubu. Icyakora, inyongera nka Thold zizakora igihe cyose Ikusanyamakuru rya kure riri mu buryo bwa <b>'online'</b>."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collector's Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump its Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Winjiye mu Ikusanyamakuru rya kure. Iyo riri <b>'online'</b>, uzashobora kureba no kugenzura igice kinini cy'Urubuga Nyamukuru rwa Kadupul nk'aho ari ho winjiriye. Nanone, ni ingenzi kumenya ko Ibikusanyamakuru bya kure bisabwa gukoresha serivisi za Kadupul zo kongera umuvuduko z'uburyo bwa <b>'On Demand Updating'</b>, kandi buri gihe tugira inama yo gukoresha Spine. Iyo Ikusanyamakuru rya kure riri <b>'offline'</b>, Urubuga rw'Ikusanyamakuru rya kure ruzaba rurimo amakuru make cyane. Icyakora, ruzabika by'agateganyo amavugurura yose kugeza igihe Ububiko bw'Amakuru Nyamukuru bwa Kadupul na Seriveri y'Urubuga bibonekeye. Hanyuma ruzohereza ibisohoka byo mu mbonerahamwe yarwo ya Boost bisubire mu Bubiko bw'Amakuru Nyamukuru bwa Kadupul kugira ngo bivugururwe."

